  "solution": {
    "text": "With neutral <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>FeCl</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> solution, phenol gives violet colour solution but <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>CH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>3</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>CH</mtext></mrow> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <mtext>OH</mtext></mrow> </math> does not give this test.<br /><math> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mn>6</mn> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>5</mn> </msub> <mtext>OH</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <msub> <mtext>FeCl</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msub> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>→</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>Fe</mtext> <msub> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>O</mtext> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>6</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>5</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>6</mn> </msub> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> </mrow> </msup> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mo>+</mo> </msup> </mrow> </mtd> <mtd> <mo>+</mo> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> <mtext>HCl</mtext> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> <mtext>Violet colour complex</mtext> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> <mtd> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </math><br />Phthalic anhydride/Conc.<math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>2</mtext> </msub> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>SO</mtext></mrow> <mtext>4</mtext> </msub> </mrow> </math> and <math> <mrow> <mtext>NaOH</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/hrtjrujuuju.JPG\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 137px;\" /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/today1.JPG\" style=\"width: 281px; height: 160px;\" /><br />Phenol cannot be distinguished from ethanol by sodium because both evolve hydrogen with sodium.<br /><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>↑</mo></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>↑</mo></math>",
